tokenomics [session sg]: declare what this session is for — `node <IMPL>/scripts/work-scope.mjs open --session sg --host claude --intent <intent> [--batch <slug> --cases <ID,ID,…>]`. Batch work: `--intent automation` WITH batch + cases (only this intent feeds cost-per-case). Anything else: pick the honest label — manual-testing, investigation, framework, onboarding, docs, other — or your own; no batch/cases needed. Then record results as they become true: `… outcome --session sg <ID>=<outcome>`.
